2. Run Git as root
cd /usr/src/kodekloudrepos/beta
sudo git status

You should see index.html as untracked.

Then:

sudo git add index.html
3. Commit
sudo git commit -m "Add index.html"

Because you're running Git as root, check whether the repository already has a configured Git identity. Do not configure one yet unless this command specifically complains about author identity.

